\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 BoJ\uc2  undertakes "exchange rate check" pointing to possible  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Tokyo, Sep. 14. The \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BoJ) today conducted a "rate check" to consult the exchange rate being used by investors, the Nikkei newspaper reported, a move interpreted as a sign of readiness to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in the face of the rapid devaluation of the yen.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's consultation, which the newspaper said it had verified with several officials pending confirmation from the BoJ, came shortly after Finance Minister \uc2 Shunichi Suzuki\uc2  reiterated the government's concern over the yen's volatility and said no options are being ruled out.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 BoJ\uc2 's rate consultation could be a preparatory move for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or a move to try to influence the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to try to stem the yen's accelerating slide.\par \par \uc2 These moves come after the yen fell more than two units against the dollar today from the previous day and showed high volatility, fluctuating from the mid 143-unit per dollar range to touch 144.96, just shy of the 145-unit barrier, a renewed 24-year low.\par \par \uc2 The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also at its lowest level in seven years against the euro.\par \par \uc2 The yen is under pressure from prospects that the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as well as its major European counterparts, will tighten monetary policy over inflation and further distance itself from the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2 's policy, which opts to keep its interest rates ultra-low.\par \par \uc2 The release of the latest US price data, which showed a larger-than-expected rise in August, has only fueled this concern ahead of next week's monthly policy meetings of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  (Fed) and the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  (BoJ).\par \par \uc2 The yen has fallen 30 units against the dollar since early March, when it was trading around 114 yen to the dollar. This is the largest annual rate of decline since 1973. EFE\par \par \uc2 mra/asb/alf\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220914ei9e003v0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
